WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.500
Module five: access as code,
and the evidence it produces.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.037
An access policy that exists only
as portal clicks can't be diffed,

3
00:00:09.037 --> 00:00:12.062
reviewed or replayed, so
it can't be assessed.

4
00:00:12.062 --> 00:00:17.465
The invariant this module enforces: every
access decision has a reviewable source of

5
00:00:17.465 --> 00:00:22.487
truth, a pipeline applies that source, and
a monitor checks the tenant against it.

6
00:00:22.487 --> 00:00:25.248
Then the evidence is
produced by doing the work,

7
00:00:25.248 --> 00:00:27.580
not reconstructed for the assessment.
